package m08core044run
    provides [checks, expected_vector, observe, case_body, descriptor, context, check, check_ref, expected_check, evidence, observation, failed, test_case]
    uses [text]

/// M08 CORE-044 "bundled transport loopback: production run shape".
/// Source: tests/integration/transport_test.go symbol
/// TestBundledTransportLoopback (L13-38).
/// Related fixtures: the seven staged suite files on the bun test command
/// line (L26) under runtime/test/; the invocation runs /usr/bin/sandbox-exec
/// with the localhost profile (L26) in a clean temp dir (L25/L27) with
/// HOME/XDG_CONFIG_HOME pointed at it and PATH=/nonexistent (L28).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the production process shape. The staged bun test
/// exits 0; its combined output contains "0 fail" plus the nine named
/// evidence needles; the invocation pins the localhost sandbox profile
/// verbatim with the hermetic env; seven suites are staged; the bundle
/// stages from CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE (skip when unset).
/// The roots-green pin lives in core-044-roots-green.can; suite semantics
/// live in core-044-transport-semantics.can.
/// Variants: none live in this file beyond the single staged run itself;
/// the suite variants (one-attempt, stalled body, redirect, malformed
/// reply, late fault) belong to the transport-semantics file.
/// Adaptation: the Go test pins non-silent bun output by containment
/// (L30: "0 fail"; L33-36: nine needles), so each needle is pinned verbatim
/// as a containment pin per the accepted CORE-014/019/040 non-silent-output
/// precedent, not by full-output equality. report-passed in the roots-green
/// file pins the L30 pass verdict; fail-needle here pins the same L30 text
/// as the output-shape pin.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec + localhost
/// bind/outbound; requires can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical
/// gates SUITE/WORK/PROC and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no
/// live run now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx
/// (L19). No CAN_TSC leg exists in this Go test, so no tsc-conditional pin
/// is authored; pinning one would over-pin.
/// Delegated oracles: none beyond DELEGATE-023 through DELEGATE-029
/// (recorded on the roots slice; not executed here).
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case transport/loopback-run checks: run-exit, fail-needle,
/// ev-loopback-json, ev-raw-fixtures, ev-one-attempt, ev-stalled,
/// ev-decode-past, ev-nominal, ev-continuations, ev-late-defect, ev-retains,
/// sandbox-profile, offline-ok, staged-suites, archive-gate.
/// Facet map (transport_test.go legs): run-exit pins exit 0 on the staged
/// run (L29-30: CombinedOutput error nil or "staged transport tests"
/// fatals); fail-needle pins the fail-free needle (L30: "0 fail" verbatim);
/// ev-loopback-json pins the JSON loopback needle (L33: "named fetch
/// loopback decodes exact JSON" verbatim; transport-named.test.ts L168);
/// ev-raw-fixtures pins the raw-fixture needle (L33: "named fetch raw
/// fixtures handle bodyless" verbatim; transport-named.test.ts L419);
/// ev-one-attempt pins the one-attempt needle (L33: "native fetch makes one
/// attempt" verbatim; transport-fetch.test.ts L14); ev-stalled pins the
/// stalled needle (L33: "stalled native response" verbatim;
/// transport-fetch.test.ts L113); ev-decode-past pins the past-deadline
/// needle (L33: "response decode past" verbatim; transport-fetch.test.ts
/// L154); ev-nominal pins the nominal-errors needle (L33: "transport
/// failures construct exact" verbatim; transport-http.test.ts L83);
/// ev-continuations pins the continuations needle (L33: "native
/// continuations finish" verbatim; transport-owned.test.ts L62);
/// ev-late-defect pins the late-defect needle (L33: "late decoder defect"
/// verbatim; transport-late.test.ts L24); ev-retains pins the retention
/// needle (L33: "native continuation retains captured resource" verbatim;
/// transport-late.test.ts L72); sandbox-profile pins the localhost
/// invocation profile verbatim (L26); offline-ok pins the hermetic run
/// (L25-28: clean temp cwd, HOME/XDG_CONFIG_HOME clean, PATH=/nonexistent);
/// staged-suites pins the seven staged suite files (L26); archive-gate pins
/// the bundle gate (L15-18: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE stages the bundle, unset
/// skips).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
